  unitName: Ocypete
  unitId: 40052
  unitNumber: 521
  description: A half-human, half-bird female monster from the birdman tribe. Though
    friends of the voracious and lusty Harpys, these unique individuals seek not
    prey, but combat. They are said to be the evolved form of battle experienced
    Aeros that've gained power after numerous encounters. According to monster researchers,
    these Ocypete's inhabit the mountains where Harpy's nest, where they take care
    of intruders in protecting their species.
  summonDesc: You smell like the battlefield!<br>Oh ho ho, I really like it.<br>No
    use refusing, I'm not leaving!
  fusionDesc: Oh ho ho, how nice of you.<br>How easy it will be to dice<br>things
    up now.
  evoDesc: Huh, what do you want?<br>Will you take me into battle?<br>Oh ho ho, I'm
    so excited.
  element: 4
  rarity: 2
